  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Awards Global Support Mechanism (AAGSM)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Mechanism will bolster DFAT capacity to improve the strategic and operational coherence of DFAT&#x2019;s scholarship programs delivery, provide technical and analytical support to improve consistency and standards across the network, and effectively monitor and report upon DFAT&apos;s scholarship programs achievements. The Mechanism will also provide DFAT with enhanced flexibility to respond to changes in the scholarship network and context in general.
The goal of the Mechanism is to contribute to a peaceful, stable and prosperous Indo-Pacific by delivering business, technical and analytical support for DFAT&#x2019;s investment in the education of a new generation of leaders. The Mechanism will achieve this by supporting DFAT to deliver high quality scholarships policy and operations though an efficient, coordinated Australia-based mechanism which supports central as well as program-driven technical and analytical support functions.</narrative>
  </description>
